; PlayQuake1280 -- PlayQuake (sound, LAN, the fastest RadeonGL settings) at
; 1280 x 720. Needs a Picasso96 mode of 1280 x 720 on the Radeon. In the GLQuake
; drawer beside PlayQuake; anything after the name goes to GLQuake too.
.KEY ARGS/F
.BRA {
.KET }
Execute PlayQuake -width 1280 -height 720 {ARGS}
